0..79 Comment "// Fibonacci\'s doubly recursive definition and its iteration agree at fourteen."
80..82 Comment "//"
83..160 Comment "// Only a run of both definitions shows that they agree. The doubly recursive"
161..225 Comment "// one makes many calls, and each call allocates unary naturals."
226..228 Comment "//"
229..309 Comment "// The path\'s endpoints are the two definitions at fourteen. The conversion runs"
310..338 Comment "// both to the same numeral."
339..341 Comment "//"
342..411 Comment "// - see: #2282 — the benchmark set, whose first probe this row was"
412..487 Comment "// - see: `pathological/data/conversion-budget.gandr` — the same claim at"
488..523 Comment "//   nineteen, past the step budget"
525..565 Comment "// The free naturals and their addition."
